-DERIVED surface — a pure function of serialized state at the step boundary —
-so a replayed run re-derives the identical timeline from the log alone. Riding
-stats.odin (an N row kind) would have churned the 5.7 stream schema for zero
-replay value (the stream's purpose is capturing the sim's own accumulators;
